.DS_Store

# The design-council plugin, deliberately untracked for now.
#
# It has never been committed and is not registered in
# .claude-plugin/marketplace.json, so it was showing up as a pile of untracked
# files on every status check and in every diff view — including two
# plugin.json files that read as if Pushpin's manifests had been renamed. This
# rule is what stops that; it is a decision to defer the plugin, not to drop it.
#
# To pick it back up: delete these two lines. Nothing else has to change.
design/

# design-council's --local seat clones (install-seats.sh --local)
seats/
